      "html": "<ul><li>Scientific name: Pangasius larnaudii Bocourt, 1866</li><li>Common names: One Spot Pangasius, Plettet Hajmalle (Denmark)</li><li>Type locality: Northern Thailand.</li><li>Synonyms: Pangasius burgini, Pangasius taeniura, Pangasius taeniurus</li><li>IUCN Red List: Least Concern (last assessed 2011)</li></ul>"
