      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1352",
      "html": "<p>Needs large amount of open space for swimming room and some plants to help reduce the nervous nature of the fish.</p>"
    },
